{"id":"n15110-2-6","stage":5,"title":"얼핏 · 猛然","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15110-2-6-1","ko":"민준이라는 이름 들었을 때 머리에 얼핏 떠오르는 거 뭐 없니?","zh":"听到‘敏俊’这个名字的时候，你脑子里会不会立刻浮现什么印象？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이라는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이라는","audio":"/audio/cf780b6a191332c2bd7b.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이름","meaning":"姓名","explanation":"이름：姓名","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"3","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었을","meaning":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","explanation":"들다：表示积极想做如前所述的行为。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49855","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리에","meaning":"头脑，脑子","explanation":"머리：头脑，脑子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"2","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼핏","meaning":"猛然","explanation":"얼핏：猛然","readings":[{"term":"얼핏","audio":"/audio/64c81c4c587c39492526.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15110","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼핏","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠오르는","meaning":"浮现","explanation":"떠오르다：浮现；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"떠오르다","audio":"/audio/82013dc8d822f21e9506.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53785","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없니?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"姓名","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"人的姓氏及附加在其后面的，只称呼其人的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"49855","definition":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头脑，脑子","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"思维判断能力。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"64c81c4c587c3949","term":"얼핏","zh":"猛然","audio":"/audio/64c81c4c587c39492526.mp3","entryId":"15110","definition":"想法或记忆等忽然短暂浮现的样子。","pronunciation":["얼핃"]},{"id":"82013dc8d822f21e","term":"떠오르다","zh":"浮现","audio":"/audio/82013dc8d822f21e9506.mp3","entryId":"53785","definition":"回忆或想起某件事。","pronunciation":["떠오르다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/575434bfc3d845feaca2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15110-2-6-2","ko":"글쎄, 잘 모르겠어.","zh":"呃，我不太清楚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/28d16eac83c14b02a8d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15110","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["呃，我不太清楚。","听到‘敏俊’这个名字的时候，你脑子里会不会立刻浮现什么印象？","刚才看到裕敏一脸困惑的样子，发生什么事了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听到‘敏俊’这个名字的时候，你脑子里会不会立刻浮现什么印象？","刚才看到裕敏一脸困惑的样子，发生什么事了吗？","呃，我不太清楚。"],"answer":2}]}
